WHAT THIS LICENCE COVERS

Bayti TV is a fork of تلفزيونك · UrTV (https://github.com/tshi-dev/UrTV) by tshi-dev, starting from its commit 51b9680.
UrTV was published without a licence. Its own code, text, images and other content therefore remain the copyright of
its author, and nothing in this repository grants any rights in them. Using them beyond what GitHub's Terms of Service
allow (viewing and forking on GitHub) needs the author's permission.

The MIT License below covers only the changes and additions made in Bayti TV after that commit: the code and text its
contributors wrote. If UrTV's author licenses UrTV, its code is available under that licence too.

Third-party parts keep their own licences:
- the home screen's base, tv-home by mihirgupta0900: MIT, android/launcher/LICENSE-tv-home
- the community debloat lists from CleanYourTV: MIT, optimize/lists/community/LICENSE-CleanYourTV.txt
- the Uthmanic Hafs font: see assets/fonts/UthmanicHafs-NOTICE.txt
- background photos fetched from Wikimedia Commons at run time: each under its own free licence, credited on screen
- Bing's photo of the day: © its photographers, shown as Bing offers it, credited on screen

